      "short": "Painting of a pond with lily pads and flowers, using thick, colorful brushstrokes in blues, greens, and purples.",
      "long": "A square-format oil painting showing a tranquil pond surface densely populated with round green lily pads and occasional pink and white water lily blossoms. The water is rendered in shifting tones of blue, teal, violet, and green, with visible impasto texture suggesting light and reflection. Brushstrokes are loose and directional, especially in the upper portion where dappled greens and purples imply reflected foliage.",
